        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "统治者把港口视为钱袋与粮道，也必须防备走私、间谍和敌舰。守城墙而失码头，往往等于把城中人的胃交给海上对手。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
